### Get all containers

GET {{host}}/api/docklightenvironments/fc6f325f-16f8-48a6-9893-09b4a526e9e6/containers

### Get Single Container

GET {{host}}/api/docklightenvironments/fc6f325f-16f8-48a6-9893-09b4a526e9e6/containers/e78112d470f2df812b527bb1fd08880f7267a18bf7130f5306c9500f45ed9f49

### Test negioate SignalR Endpoints (Websocket)
POST {{host}}/ws/docklight/negotiate?environmentId=18fe86bd-a631-4690-a315-4f1f85fc0e64

Content-Type application/json

### Send request for starting containers
POST {{host}}/api/docklightenvironments/fc6f325f-16f8-48a6-9893-09b4a526e9e6/containers/e78112d470f2df812b527bb1fd08880f7267a18bf7130f5306c9500f45ed9f49/start
Content-Type: application/json

